# THE SEAM'S SILENT DIRECTION: the agent spells the RUNTIME verb as a
# letters-only proper noun (Fxwrite -> fxwrite).  The seat injects the ABSTRACT
# symbol (Writeverb -> writeverb), so the contention for Fxwrite matches
# NOTHING and the argument derives no contention for the call's real verb.
A call C1 is grounded in a verb W1 if C1 is named W1.
A call C1 contends for Fxwrite if C1 is grounded in Fxwrite.
